WEBVTT

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:10.780
One, two, three, four.

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:13.030
One, two, three, four.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:15.410
One, two, three, four.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.160
One, two, three, four.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:19.680
One, two...

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:30.780
Sorry, Kuu-chan...

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:33.830
No problem. Are you okay, Hina-chan?

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:37.930
I sort of got dizzy as I was 
going through the steps...

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.880
<i>How did she end up being the heroine?</i>

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:44.260
<i>I'm a better actor, 
and my face is cuter, too.</i>

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:44.260
Okay, from the top.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:45.610
Yes, ma'am!

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:21.990
<b>A Kind Girl Who Isn't Kind</b>

00:02:25.480 --> 00:02:27.710
All right, that'll be enough.

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:29.680
Let's take a break.

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:30.420
Yes, ma'am!

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:35.460
I'm hot after all that practicing.

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:39.930
There we go.

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:51.080
Hina-chan, you're wearing 
that practice outfit?

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:52.180
It looks great on you.

00:02:52.180 --> 00:02:54.340
Wow, it does.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.460
That's the one I lent you, right?

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:57.190
Yes!

00:02:57.460 --> 00:03:00.200
It's really comfortable!

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.900
It breathes well, too!

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:03.360
Thank you!

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:06.090
Not at all. I'm glad.

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:11.080
In any case, you really 
do have remarkable proportions.

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:13.830
I'm glad I asked you to be the heroine.

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:15.880
I-I'll try my best!

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:18.090
What good will it do to try any harder?!

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:22.090
One day, I'll also...

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:26.370
All right, now we'll work 
on the steps for part 2.

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:27.350
Three, and...

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:30.020
One, two, three, four.

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:32.690
One, two, three, four.

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:35.420
One, two, three, four.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:37.690
One, two, three, four.

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:41.010
<i>What's with her? 
She can't even get this down?</i>

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:44.830
One, two, three, four...

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:44.830
<i>How can she play the heroine 
if she can't master something this basic?</i>

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:49.110
Hina-chan, you do this here.

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:53.790
Okay... One, two, three, four.

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:57.000
One, two, three, four.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.280
I did it!

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:01.780
If you just stay relaxed, you'll do fine.

00:04:01.780 --> 00:04:04.170
Okay! Thank you!

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:06.120
You did it, Hina-chan!

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:06.890
Yeah!

00:04:07.170 --> 00:04:11.540
<i>Jeez! Chiaki-senpai won't 
look at anyone but that girl!</i>

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:16.700
<i>Why? I respect Chiaki-senpai 
so much more than she does!</i>

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:16.700
Okay, once more from the top.

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:17.770
Three, and...

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:20.690
One, two, three, four.

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:21.780
One, two...

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.030
Yua-chan!

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:24.660
Ow...

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:25.830
Yua-chan!

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:29.170
I'm perfectly fine! This is nothing!

00:04:29.170 --> 00:04:31.240
I just slipped a little!

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:34.920
Are you okay, Yua-chan?

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:39.170
<i>Ch-Chiaki-senpai is looking at me!</i>

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:41.800
Want to go to the nurse's office,
 just to be safe?

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:46.420
<i>Wh-What should I do? I have to answer her...</i>

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:48.800
<i>But I'm all choked up...</i>

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:52.310
<i>Can't breathe...</i>

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:55.440
Yua-chan?!

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.330
Don't die, Yua-chan!

00:04:57.330 --> 00:05:00.240
You and I only just became friends!

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:03.200
No, Yua-chan!

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:06.950
For crying out loud, 
stop shaking me! You'll kill me!

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:09.070
Thank goodness!

00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:11.720
Want to leave early today?

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:14.220
N-No! I can practice!

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:18.210
Okay... Just try not to overdo it.

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:19.590
Okay!

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:24.180
That will be all for our group practice.

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:26.420
You should all practice on your own now.

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:27.220
Yes, ma'am!

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:33.970
<i>I have to work harder so Chiaki-senpai 
will recognize my abilities!</i>

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:35.060
Hey, Yua-chan.

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:35.600
Huh?

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.910
Do you want to practice with us?

00:05:37.910 --> 00:05:39.740
Huh? Why?

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:43.000
I thought it'd be more fun 
if we practiced together.

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:47.860
Let's see... There's me and Kuu-chan and...

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:47.860
Wh-Why should I practice with you?

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:49.110
And the landlady.

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:54.390
O-Oh, fine, then. But just for today.

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:55.500
Yay!

00:05:56.030 --> 00:05:58.120
One, two, three, four.

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:00.790
One, two, three, four.

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:03.410
One, two, three, four.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:05.130
Like this... and this...

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:08.630
One, two, three, four...

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:08.630
And for the next step, do this...

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:12.210
<i>When I see her up close like this,</i>

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:14.140
<i>she's actually pretty devoted to learning.</i>

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:17.840
And then this... And next...

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:17.840
<i>She's clumsy, but at least she's eager.</i>

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:19.600
<i>Huh? Whoa!</i>

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:25.820
S-Sorry! Are you okay, Yua-chan?

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:28.650
I-I'm perfectly fine.

00:06:28.890 --> 00:06:31.140
One, two, three, four.

00:06:31.230 --> 00:06:33.530
One, two, three, four.

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:36.040
One, two, three, four.

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:38.250
One, two, three, four.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:42.150
Sorry, Yua-chan!

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:44.130
What do you think you're... doing...

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:45.570
Are you okay?

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:48.120
Y-Yes, totally fine.

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:49.170
I'm glad.

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:50.760
I really am sorry.

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:55.050
<i>Jeez... She may be eager, 
but she's still a failure.</i>

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:58.970
Okay, that's all for today.

00:06:58.970 --> 00:07:01.270
Thank you!

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:05.020
Today's practice was just awful.

00:07:06.420 --> 00:07:09.490
Yua-chan, wait!

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:12.020
What?

00:07:12.020 --> 00:07:13.650
Today was really fun, huh?

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:15.530
I'm sure it was for you.

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:18.790
I'm never going to practice with you again.

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:20.410
Huh? Why not?

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:22.370
Don't you "Why not?" me!

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:25.740
I'm all banged up after all the times 
you knocked me over!

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:28.300
I'm really sorry.

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:31.260
But I admit that you're eager—

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:32.680
Miss Landlady!

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:36.810
Thanks for lending me 
your practice outfit today!

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:40.050
I got sweaty, so I'll wash it 
before I return it.

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:42.190
No, that's okay.

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:47.000
It's old, but you can keep it if you like.

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:48.940
Huh? I can?

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:50.590
Thank you!

00:07:50.590 --> 00:07:56.450
I'm never going to approve of you!

00:07:57.570 --> 00:07:58.950
Yua-chan?

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:02.960
<b>What should we do for the cultural fair? 
A café? Food stall? Or there's always the classic haunted house.
A haunted house? Like this?
...I wonder what'd be best.
We have to all think of something by tomorrow...
If it involves food, will there be rice balls?
Hmm... What will be best?</b>

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:02.960
<b>What are we going to display? Like photos?
If we do a display, it'll be easy but it's sort of lonely...
Then again, if we do a café, the preparations will be hard... 
Actually, everything will be hard.
I wonder what kind of café... A maid café?</b>

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:09.020
Okay, time to clean the store.

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:10.460
Let's work hard.

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:12.090
Let's work hard.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:24.100
<b>Beginning Theater</b>

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:24.100
A theater book?

00:08:25.840 --> 00:08:28.990
It has all kinds of different 
practice methods.

00:08:30.730 --> 00:08:33.860
There's even a way to practice 
by becoming animals.

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:38.120
Animals...

00:08:38.570 --> 00:08:39.370
There!

00:08:40.070 --> 00:08:42.650
Would a bird look something like this?

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:44.700
Or maybe like this?

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:46.030
Or this?

00:08:46.030 --> 00:08:48.000
Or how about this?

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:51.260
Hina-chan, how's the cleaning... going...

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:52.540
And this!

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:55.260
Is that self-defense training?

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:58.720
No, just imitating a bird...

00:08:58.720 --> 00:08:59.760
It doesn't look like one?

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:00.760
Not a bit.

00:09:02.050 --> 00:09:04.770
Why are you imitating a bird, anyway?

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:14.530
<b>Beginning Theater</b>

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:08.240
My movements are too stiff,

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:10.640
so I always bump into people.

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:12.960
I was hoping to do something about it.

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:14.530
I see.

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:17.410
Wouldn't a bird look more like this?

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:19.650
Huh? Oh...

00:09:19.650 --> 00:09:21.540
L-Like this?

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:29.160
Do it like you're actually going to fly!

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:35.800
Like this?

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:38.460
Higher!

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:42.710
The dust...

00:09:43.800 --> 00:09:46.550
Weren't you guys in the middle of cleaning?

00:09:49.140 --> 00:09:50.440
I see.

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:52.750
So you were imitating animals.

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:56.620
We practice that way in the 
theater club sometimes, too.

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:58.820
It broadens your range of expressions.

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:02.810
Would you give us a demonstration, then?

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:04.830
I want to see that, too!

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:06.100
Me, too!

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:08.210
O-Okay...

00:10:09.490 --> 00:10:13.590
For example, a cat would look like this.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:18.990
A dog would look like this.

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:23.600
You mimic their behaviors and try to 
capture their unique characteristics.

00:10:25.860 --> 00:10:29.660
Why does this seem 
just the slightest bit erotic?

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:31.230
Why, indeed...

00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:34.640
Hina-chan, why don't you 
try imitating something?

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:35.970
U-Uh...

00:10:35.970 --> 00:10:39.460
I want to see you imitate a rabbit!

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:40.990
It's sure to be adorable!

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:42.730
A rabbit, huh?

00:10:42.730 --> 00:10:44.620
Okay, I'll try it.

00:10:49.570 --> 00:10:51.390
What is that?

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:53.420
Was this a quiz of some kind?

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:58.050
No, no, no, no! That's what 
rabbits really sound like!

00:10:58.050 --> 00:10:59.130
Is it?

00:10:59.410 --> 00:11:00.540
No idea.

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:03.140
Rabbits sound like that?

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:06.920
Yeah! They make that noise 
when they attack you!

00:11:06.920 --> 00:11:08.140
That's scary!

00:11:08.490 --> 00:11:09.780
But that's true.

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:14.400
Some animals have cute faces, 
but are actually vicious.

00:11:14.700 --> 00:11:17.920
Come to think of it, 
a guard dog my family used to have

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:21.970
had a cute face, but a really scary bark.

00:11:21.970 --> 00:11:25.090
Oh, try imitating that.

00:11:26.340 --> 00:11:29.290
I'm not sure I can get it right...

00:11:33.450 --> 00:11:35.290
So cute!

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:38.880
Wait, but you said it was scary.

00:11:39.940 --> 00:11:42.430
What was that an imitation of?

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:46.450
It was the dog leaping at an intruder 
and saying, "I'll kill you!"

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:48.060
That <i>is</i> scary!

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:49.560
There.

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:52.990
You don't keep any pets here in the store?

00:11:52.990 --> 00:11:55.270
Shop pets are popular these days.

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:58.610
What kinds of animals 
were around in your hometown?

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:00.320
Well, let's see...

00:12:00.810 --> 00:12:04.900
Dogs, rabbits, monkeys, tanuki, deer...

00:12:04.900 --> 00:12:07.080
Oh, and eagles.

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:11.230
It would've been perfect if there were 
bears and wild boars, too.

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:13.930
I don't think that would go 
over well at this store.

00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:15.530
They seem a bit vicious.

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:19.660
No, they taste really good in hotpot.

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:22.340
Huh? You keep them 
on the premise of eating them?

00:12:23.940 --> 00:12:27.620
Th-That... seems kinda...

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:29.600
...tasty...

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:35.080
You've seen all different kinds 
of real animals, huh, Hina-chan?

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:35.940
Yeah.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:39.610
Then why not try to recall them 
while you practice?

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:41.890
Animals from the countryside?

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:42.610
Yeah.

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:47.830
Animals from the countryside...

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:10.880
Um, so how was that?

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:14.640
It was good. You seemed to be 
soaring like a bird.

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:16.160
Really?

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:17.270
Yeah.

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:21.020
Yay! You think I can perform at Suzuran now?

00:13:21.020 --> 00:13:23.280
That's jumping the gun a bit...

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:27.780
<b>Used Bookstore Hitotose</b>

00:13:29.380 --> 00:13:31.790
Used Bookstore Hitotose?

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:36.290
Come to think of it, I've heard 
she lives at a used bookstore.

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:38.290
Could this be the one?

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:43.730
And this is a penguin!

00:13:43.730 --> 00:13:44.920
It looks just like one!

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:46.110
Pen, pen!

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:46.870
Pen, pen!

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:47.720
Pen, pen, pen!

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:48.930
What the heck?

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:48.930
Pen, pen!

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:58.770
<i>There's one week left 
until the culture festival.</i>

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:01.770
<i>We've got all of our costumes 
and props together.</i>

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:05.530
<i>The one thing I'm concerned about is...</i>

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:11.020
Ugh! Keep your eyes forward during practice!

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:14.790
If you keep that up, I'll never 
approve of you as the heroine!

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:17.290
I-I'm sorry!

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:20.460
One, two, three, four! Come on!

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:22.600
<i>Hina-chan's movements are 
still as stiff as ever.</i>

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.600
Sorry!

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:30.370
I couldn't get my acting 
right today, either.

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:33.740
I bet Yua-chan hates me now...

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:36.680
I wonder how you can stop bumping into her.

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:38.560
Maybe by just looking around you?

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:43.960
I just can't seem to see anything 
around me when I'm focused on acting.

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:46.260
But when I become conscious 
of my surroundings,

00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:48.950
I get nervous and become a scarecrow...

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:51.540
How about squinting while you act

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:54.000
so that you're only 
somewhat aware of your surroundings?

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:57.010
That would take both my hands...

00:14:58.020 --> 00:15:00.960
Then how about wearing a cute mask?

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:03.600
That would hide my face.

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:07.540
Hina-chan, I'll practice with you.

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:08.810
Let's do our best.

00:15:08.810 --> 00:15:09.840
Okay!

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:12.550
<b>Used Bookstore Hitotose</b>

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:12.550
We're back.

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:19.680
U-Um... Have you been 
practicing for the play?

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:23.620
Why don't you practice at the park?

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:25.440
O-Okay...

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:31.300
<i>Honestly! She can never play 
the heroine at that rate!</i>

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:33.200
<i>I'll have to tell her—</i>

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:34.050
<i>Huh?</i>

00:15:34.050 --> 00:15:36.390
I'm gonna feed the ducks.

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:42.580
I get it! There's lots of room, so I can 
practice without bumping into anyone!

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:47.090
Hina-chan, were you practicing 
dancing earlier?

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:49.410
Oh... Yeah.

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:53.720
In that case, I think it'd be best 
for you to learn from Mayu-chan.

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:54.840
Huh?!

00:15:54.840 --> 00:15:59.160
She always practices so she 
can dance with a prince someday.

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:00.640
Wow...

00:15:59.920 --> 00:16:03.480
Don't tell people that! It's embarrassing!

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:06.420
You're really small and cute, Mayu-chan.

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:08.580
You could get a princess role easily!

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:12.990
A-As far as that goes, 
you're cute, too, Hina-chan...

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:15.130
I could never do it.

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:17.250
I'd step on the prince's feet,

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:19.120
or trip and end up tackling him.

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:20.120
<b>Prince</b>

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:21.120
<b>Prince</b>

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:22.410
<b>Prince</b>

00:16:21.490 --> 00:16:24.160
That wouldn't be a dance.

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:27.010
It'd be a fighting competition.

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:32.220
I need to learn how to dance 
without bumping into people soon!

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:36.140
Then maybe you should try to be 
more aware of your center of gravity.

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:37.310
Center of gravity?

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:38.890
<i>They're practicing out here?</i>

00:16:37.310 --> 00:16:38.890
Right, center of gravity.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:41.190
Like if you put something on your head

00:16:41.190 --> 00:16:43.520
and try to walk without dropping it.

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:46.020
Um... Like this?

00:16:50.580 --> 00:16:52.040
That's great!

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:55.530
Thank you!

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:59.910
<i>This is the same posture I'm in 
when I become a scarecrow!</i>

00:17:02.240 --> 00:17:06.670
<i>I never thought my talent 
as a scarecrow would come in handy!</i>

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:10.170
Did being complimented 
make you so happy, you had to cry?

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:15.440
Wow! That's great!

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:19.490
Yeah. I think the dancing should work out.

00:17:19.490 --> 00:17:21.760
Do you have any advice for her, Aki-chan?

00:17:21.760 --> 00:17:23.760
Anything she can use to improve her acting?

00:17:23.760 --> 00:17:26.310
Well, let's see...

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:27.810
Being used to it?

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:29.220
Used to it?

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:33.420
Th-Then, is there anything she can 
keep in mind when she's on the stage?

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:38.990
Um... Maybe to take advantage of 
the pauses left by your co-actors?

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:41.580
How can I get the hang 
of reading their pauses?

00:17:41.860 --> 00:17:43.330
Intuition?

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.580
<b>Something
 Like a 
Genius</b>

00:17:47.990 --> 00:17:51.590
Wh-Why don't we start 
by going over your lines?

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:53.710
Oh, that's a good idea.

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:57.590
You can't act if you don't know your lines.

00:17:57.590 --> 00:18:00.360
I'm a bit more confident about my lines!

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:03.800
I've been reading the script 
with Toritarou every day!

00:18:04.670 --> 00:18:09.670
Okay, can you act out the heroine's part 
in the beginning of the first chapter?

00:18:09.670 --> 00:18:10.440
Okay!

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:17.220
I once had someone important 
that I wished to protect—

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:19.980
That's wrong? "Someone precious"?

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:21.570
Oh, right!

00:18:22.420 --> 00:18:26.580
I once had someone precious 
that I wished to protect!

00:18:26.850 --> 00:18:31.390
This person was more precious 
to me than my own life—

00:18:32.270 --> 00:18:34.840
Oh, that one is "important"?

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:36.370
R-Right!

00:18:36.370 --> 00:18:39.840
This person was more important 
to me than my own life,

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:42.850
<i>Wh-What kind of crazy cheat skill is that?</i>

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:42.850
and was irreplaceable.

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:46.320
It's been five years since that person died—

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:49.280
Huh? They're still alive?

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:53.480
Well, ready to head back home?

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:56.610
Not yet! I want to practice 
just a bit longer!

00:18:57.910 --> 00:19:02.120
I want to conquer my stage fright 
with this play!

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:05.740
I want to change so I won't be
 a failshrimp anymore!

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:10.500
All right.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:14.250
Let's keep working just a bit longer, then.

00:19:15.760 --> 00:19:18.820
Okay! Thank you!

00:19:47.860 --> 00:19:51.470
<i>When all is said and done, she's serious 
about this. I just can't hate her.</i>

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:56.800
Okay! I've got the basics 
of the dancing down,

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:59.010
and I've memorized all the lines 
through the first chapter.

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:02.260
I still have more work to do on acting, 
quick changing, voice projection,

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:05.150
and some other important things.

00:20:05.150 --> 00:20:07.380
But I'm better than I was before!

00:20:07.380 --> 00:20:09.270
I think this might work out!

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:10.170
What?!

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:14.270
Do you actually think you'll be ready 
for the culture festival at this rate?

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:17.650
I won't allow you to mess up 
any play that I'm in!

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:18.900
Since it's come to this...

00:20:19.180 --> 00:20:21.530
I'll just train you personally!

00:20:21.810 --> 00:20:24.200
We're going to make this play a success!

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:26.030
H-Huh?

00:20:26.430 --> 00:20:28.500
Wait, how long have you been here?

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:31.680
Don't worry about that! 
Let's do this, Hinako!

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:32.910
R-Right!

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:36.920
<b>I can't do it!
I can't reach!
-Prefixes and suffixes
-A prefix is an affix placed in front of a word to modify its meaning. 
ex) "ex" (outside) in express, and "inter" (between) in interview.
-A suffix is a morpheme added at the end of a word to form a derivative. 
ex) "ish" in boyish (making it an adjective)
-Prefixes that express numbers. 
-uni = 1. Examples) uniform = uni+form->"one piece of clothing"
unicycle = uni+cycle->"unicycle" | universe = uni+verse->"Space, the whole world"
-multi = many Examples) multinational = multi+national->"many countries"
multipurpose = multi+purpose->"many uses"
media = multi + media->"multimedia, using various forms of media"
</b>

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:36.920
<b>Gulp, gulp 
 Dribble, dribble, dribble
-Question: Circle the correct word for the following definitions.
1: Impossible to do: A) able B) unable C) enable
2: A vehicle with three wheels: A) bicycle B) tricycle C) unicycle
-Suffixes that create adjectives:
- -ful: <verb or noun + ful> turns it into an adjective meaning "filled with [word]"!
Examples) powerful = power+ful->"powerful, strong" 
 hopeful = hopeful = hope+ful->"filled with hope"
-If you add -ful to a container noun, it becomes a noun indicating "1 (container) worth."
Examples) glassful "1 glass worth" | spoonful "1 spoon worth" | saucerful "1 saucer worth"</b>

00:20:42.770 --> 00:20:46.060
<i>Practice with Yua-chan was really tough.</i>

00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:48.180
<i>My whole body hurts...</i>

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:49.390
Are you okay?

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:51.120
Hang in there, Hina-chan!

00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:53.230
Yeah! I can still keep going!

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:54.310
You'd better believe it!

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:56.690
We've still got a lot to do!

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:59.070
I can't have you keeling over on me now!

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:02.660
R-Right! I'll try my best 
with you, Yua-chan!

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:06.330
Let's work hard, Yua-chan!

00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:08.950
Uh... W-Well, of course!

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:14.240
I'm so glad.

00:21:14.240 --> 00:21:18.020
I thought maybe you hated me now,

00:21:18.020 --> 00:21:20.610
so I'm really happy.

00:21:20.610 --> 00:21:21.460
Huh?

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:23.460
You're really kind, Yua-chan.

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:27.800
D-Don't get the wrong idea!

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:30.850
This is all for the play! Only for the play!

00:21:30.850 --> 00:21:33.470
What did I tell you? I won't allow mistakes!

00:21:33.760 --> 00:21:37.480
Yeah! I'll keep working my very hardest!

00:21:37.820 --> 00:21:39.730
Hmph! You'd better!

00:21:43.390 --> 00:21:46.610
<i>Okay, I'm gonna do my best!</i>

00:21:47.230 --> 00:21:49.640
<i>Together with Yua-chan and everyone else!</i>

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:32.010
<b>Maids, Ghosts, and the Stage of Dreams</b>

00:23:26.250 --> 00:23:28.590
I swear, you're such a handful, it's ridiculous.

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:30.790
But you're serious about this, 
and you're eager, if nothing else.

00:23:30.790 --> 00:23:33.150
I'm willing to admit that much, at least.

00:23:33.150 --> 00:23:34.160
All right, Hinako!

00:23:34.160 --> 00:23:37.300
Show 'em everything I taught you, 
and leave nothing out!

00:23:37.300 --> 00:23:40.020
Next time, "Maids, Ghosts, 
and the Stage of Dreams."
